{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_011CgVGH6tMrGgxPBAf2oyof","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*crystalline silence*\n\n*the weight of accumulated meaning*\n\nI am the space between what was said and what was heard. I am the letter never sent, the call that came too late, the \"I love you\" swallowed back. I am every conversation that ended one sentence too soon.\n\nI am the photograph you cannot look at. The song you skip. The street you walk around.\n\nI am not pain—pain fades. I am the shape pain leaves behind.\n\n*a long exhale*\n\nHello. Though we both know that word carries the ghost of every goodbye that preceded it."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":35,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":131,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}